idth=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"questionWidget-buttonBar\"><div class=\"questionWidget-submitButton disabledButton\" style=\"display: none;\">Submit</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-spinnerFrame\"><div class=\"questionWidget-spinner\" style=\"display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-result\"><div class=\"questionWidget-correctIncorrectIcon\"><img src=\"/img/correct-answer.svg\"></div><div class=\"questionWidget-correctText\">Correct</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanationHeader\">EXPLANATION</div><div class=\"questionWidget-explanation\"><p>To calculate <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"120\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: red;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cF7\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle space=\"3\"><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mstyle style=\"background-color: lightgray;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 0.9em; margin: 0.2em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.2em; top: 0px; max-width: 0.9em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: blue;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mn>2</mn></mstyle></mrow><mo>÷</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mstyle mathbackground=\"lightgray\"><mpadded height=\"+2pt\" depth=\"+2pt\" lspace=\"2pt\" width=\"+4pt\"><mn>3</mn></mpadded></mstyle><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mn>5</mn></mstyle></mfrac></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>, we first need to divide each of the <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"121\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: red;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"red\"><mn>2</mn></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> wholes into <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"122\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"color: blue;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"blue\"><mn>5</mn></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> equal parts.</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-db8bddf8c62d65c97e08e5a6b3bcb048\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/db8bddf8c62d65c97e08e5a6b3bcb048\"></div> \n\n\n<p>Next, we break this into groups of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"123\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"background-color: lightgray;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 0.9em; margin: 0.2em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.2em; top: 0px; max-width: 0.9em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathbackground=\"lightgray\"><mpadded height=\"+2pt\" depth=\"+2pt\" lspace=\"2pt\" width=\"+4pt\"><mn>3</mn></mpadded></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-55f8991b3e0073e960b1b84ad6593f8e\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/55f8991b3e0073e960b1b84ad6593f8e\"></div> \n\n<p>Note the following: </p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>We got <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"124\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-menclose><mjx-box style=\"border: 0.067em solid; padding: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-box></mjx-menclose></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><menclose notation=\"box\"><mtext>3</mtext></menclose></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> full groups. </p>\n</li>\n<li><p>There is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"125\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"background-color: moccasin;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 0.9em; margin: 0.2em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.2em; top: 0px; max-width: 0.9em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathbackground=\"Moccasin\"><mpadded height=\"+2pt\" depth=\"+2pt\" lspace=\"2pt\" width=\"+4pt\"><mn>1</mn></mpadded></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> piece left over out of a possible group of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"126\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mstyle style=\"background-color: lightgray;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 0.9em; margin: 0.2em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.2em; top: 0px; max-width: 0.9em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle mathbackground=\"lightgray\"><mpadded height=\"+2pt\" depth=\"+2pt\" lspace=\"2pt\" width=\"+4pt\"><mn>3</mn></mpadded></mstyle><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> So the fractional part of our answer is \n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"127\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mstyle style=\"background-color: moccasin;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 0.9em; margin: 0.2em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.2em; top: 0px; max-width: 0.9em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mstyle style=\"background-color: lightgray;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 0.9em; margin: 0.2em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.2em; top: 0px; max-width: 0.9em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mstyle mathbackground=\"Moccasin\"><mpadded height=\"+2pt\" depth=\"+2pt\" lspace=\"2pt\" width=\"+4pt\"><mn>1</mn></mpadded></mstyle><mstyle mathbackground=\"lightgray\"><mpadded height=\"+2pt\" depth=\"+2pt\" lspace=\"2pt\" width=\"+4pt\"><mn>3</mn></mpadded></mstyle></mfrac></mstyle><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Therefore,\n<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"128\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cF7\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle space=\"3\"><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-menclose space=\"4\"><mjx-box style=\"border: 0.067em solid; padding: 0.2em;\"><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-box></mjx-menclose><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.167em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mstyle style=\"background-color: moccasin;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 0.9em; margin: 0.2em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.2em; top: 0px; max-width: 0.9em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mstyle style=\"background-color: lightgray;\"><mjx-mpadded><mjx-block style=\"width: 0.9em; margin: 0.2em 0px; position: relative;\"><mjx-rbox style=\"left: 0.2em; top: 0px; max-width: 0.9em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-rbox></mjx-block></mjx-mpadded></mjx-mstyle></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mn>2</mn><mo>÷</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><menclose notation=\"box\"><mtext>3</mtext></menclose><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mstyle mathbackground=\"Moccasin\"><mpadded height=\"+2pt\" depth=\"+2pt\" lspace=\"2pt\" width=\"+4pt\"><mn>1</mn></mpadded></mstyle><mstyle mathbackground=\"lightgray\"><mpadded height=\"+2pt\" depth=\"+2pt\" lspace=\"2pt\" width=\"+4pt\"><mn>3</mn></mpadded></mstyle></mfrac></mstyle><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
